## Why Asked
Interviewers test understanding of React Native's architecture and how to extend functionality beyond standard JavaScript APIs.

## Key Concepts
- Bridge communication between JavaScript and native code
- Access to device hardware (camera, GPS, sensors)
- Performance optimization for computationally intensive tasks
- Third-party SDK integration

## Code Example
```
// Android Native Module
@ReactMethod
public void getDeviceInfo(Promise promise) {
  try {
    String deviceModel = Build.MODEL;
    promise.resolve(deviceModel);
  } catch (Exception e) {
    promise.reject("ERROR", e.getMessage());
  }
}

// JavaScript usage
import { NativeModules } from 'react-native';
const { DeviceInfo } = NativeModules;

const getModel = async () => {
  const model = await DeviceInfo.getDeviceInfo();
  console.log(model);
};
```

